('Follow his final passes against China PR and Spain.', "Suivre ses dernières passes contre la RP de Chine et l'Espagne.", 'Fuatilia pasi zake za mwisho dhidi ya China na Hispania.', 'Acompanhe os passes finais dele contra a RP da China e a Espanha.'),
('Follow his final passes against Cuba on 23 November.', 'Suivre ses dernières passes contre Cuba le 23 novembre.', 'Fuatilia pasi zake za mwisho dhidi ya Cuba tarehe 23 Novemba.', 'Acompanhe os passes finais dele contra Cuba em 23 de novembro.'),
('Follow his involvement against China PR on 23 November.', 'Suivre son influence contre la RP de Chine le 23 novembre.', 'Fuatilia mchango wake dhidi ya China tarehe 23 Novemba.', 'Acompanhe a participação dele contra a RP da China em 23 de novembro.'),
